Source: byteguru
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: ByteguruOS Team <devel@byteguru.example>
Build-Depends:
 debhelper-compat (= 13),
 meson,
 ninja-build,
 pkg-config,
 libwayland-dev,
 libxkbcommon-dev,
 libpixman-1-dev,
 libcairo2-dev,
 libwlroots-0.18-dev,
 python3,
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: byteguru-compositor
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libwlroots-0.18, xkb-data
Description: Wayland compositor for ByteguruOS (bgwl)
 Minimal wlroots-based compositor: outputs and hotplug, xdg-shell,
 layer-shell for the panel, libinput with ru/us layouts, simple SSD
 titlebars. No XWayland, no workspaces, no tiling yet.

Package: byteguru-shell
Architecture: all
Section: x11
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0,
 byteguru-data, byteguru-apps-daemon
Description: ByteguruOS desktop shell components
 Panel, application launcher, settings and first-run wizard built on GTK4.
 The state model (panel, settings schema, wizard routing) is separated from
 the widgets and unit-tested.

Package: byteguru-apps-daemon
Architecture: all
Section: admin
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, byteguru-wincompat, flatpak
Description: ByteguruOS session daemon with a unified application model
 Presents Flatpak apps, .desktop entries and WCV manifests as one list and
 returns an executable launch plan, including coverage level and sandbox
 warnings.

Package: byteguru-wincompat
Architecture: all
Section: admin
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.11),
 apparmor, apparmor-utils, wine64 | wine, winetricks, ca-certificates
# TODO-VERIFY: dxvk в Debian не пакетирован — поставляется отдельным
# пакетом нашего репозитория; wine64/winetricks сверить с trixie
Description: WinCompat subsystem for running Windows applications
 WCV manifest validation, per-application prefixes with rollback, drive letter
 and path visibility filter, AppArmor/seccomp policy generation, coverage
 registry where a level is only published from recorded runs.

Package: byteguru-installer
Architecture: all
Section: admin
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.11), partimage | ntfs-3g,
 gdisk, dosfstools, e2fsprogs, btrfs-progs, exfatprogs, efibootmgr, cryptsetup
Description: ByteguruOS installer with dual-boot support
 Disk layout planner working on contiguous free segments, safety gates
 (hibernation, BitLocker, dirty NTFS block changes), EFI boot entry repair
 after Windows updates and a clock policy for machines with both systems.

Package: byteguru-data
Architecture: all
Section: admin
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Data files for ByteguruOS
 WCV example manifests, desktop entries, systemd user units, Wayland session
 entry and the shell CSS theme.
